  "description": "Declarative keyframe animation for Blazor on the Web Animations API - the same Keyframes / Track / Key model as Shiny.Maui.Controls.Keyframe, with a seekable player, choreography and stagger, animated visual-state transitions, implicit property transitions, list item transitions (enter, exit and FLIP moves), custom keyframe page transitions, spring and bounce easing, and reduced motion honoured by default.",
